      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently applaud veterinarians such as Dr Farr, Dr DeAngelis, Dr Wallace, and Dr Washatka for their gentle demeanour and genuine devotion to pet well-being. Pet owners value the thoughtful comfort provided during difficult palliative decisions, though one reviewer felt pressured by aggressive treatment recommendations."
