      "title": {
        "en": "Patient handling for calm veterinary visits"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight the team's ability to keep dogs and cats relaxed throughout physical examinations and surgical preparation. Reviewers note that staff handle companion animals with warmth and patience, reducing stress for rescue pets and providing reassurance during routine dental procedures under anaesthesia."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
