      "title": {
        "en": "Dependable surgical recovery and wound care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Multiple reviewers report positive outcomes for urgent wound treatments, successful puppy dental cleanings, and comfortable geriatric management. While one client noted unresolved vomiting following an urgent care visit, most pet owners express confidence in the clinical treatments and postoperative guidance received."
      }
    }
